  "accepted_design": [
    "One default-inferred typed saved-content dimension only for native-upgraded occurrence; ordinary required read, allowed real read, inactive/pure output and preserving write remain distinct. Supported saved shape validated; native twelve-byte ledger unchanged.",
    "Keep original two0x37/group0/order/native write classification/version stream/usage/ranges/owners; strict intent dominates dedup. No new caller API granting undefined writes.",
    "Use pre-pass input frontier for every read of affected logical resource, including strict partial/version aliases; publish real writes after all checks. Other resources retain current behavior.",
    "Retain every real available producer even when missing input is explicitly allowed; only declared written output range becomes initialized for later normal reads/exports.",
    "Cold, warm, subgraph, compose and independent checker must implement same frontier semantics without simply sharing resolver result; typed state participates in normalized keys and size accounting.",
    "First actual reverse sample_self=false self-top read only uses existing explicit allow-read API. Tail/later reverse/other callers remain strict and no clear, seed, inactive marking or rebind is permitted.",
    "Graph-managed compute descriptor layout comes from validated scheduled RangeProgram for exact selected view; missing/mixed/wrong coverage fails. Actual sampled top and storage GENERAL, sampled-only READ_ONLY. No shadername heuristic or unconditional fallback."
  ],
  "required_implementation_validation": [
    "Same actual red fixture turns green retaining native dual37 and range; retain3controls.",
    "Ordinary requiredread falsePrevious, strict exact/partial aliases in both orders, post-upgrade unsupported sequence, preserved/atomicoldcontent, defined genuine producer controls.",
    "Later ordinary read/export of unselectedrange stillfails, writtenrange succeeds, permission never crosses pass.",
    "Changed import boundary on borrowed hit, typed-only/fullkey forcedcollision, cached subgraph composition, malformed saved shape and independent checker/native oracle.",
    "Actual BindlessResource passed to existing writer with exact GENERAL/READ_ONLY, individualviews, missing/mixedcoverage and culled earlierpass.",
    "Central original immutableSPV GPU chain: genuine initializedpartial/freshfull/same top readwrite, originalfullchain, validation errors fail, output tolerance; no fullgame claim."
  ],
